spans.s:
cl. 1. Ā. ई॑क्षते, ईक्षां-चक्रे (Pāṇ. i, 3, 63), ईक्षिष्यते, ऐक्षिष्ट, ईक्षितुम्, to see, look, view, behold, look at, gaze at;
to watch over (with acc. or rarely loc.), AV.; AitBr.; ŚBr.; Mn.; Kathās. &c.;
to see in one's mind, think, have a thought, ŚBr.; ChUp.; MBh.; Bhag. &c.;
to regard, consider, Kum.;
to observe (the stars &c.), VarBṛS.;
to foretell for (dat.; lit. to observe the stars for any one), Pāṇ. i, 4, 39 :
Caus. ईक्षयति, to make one look at (with acc.), ĀśvGṛ. (This root is perhaps connected with अक्षि, q.v.)
